{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 12, :comments ["<b>Its interpretation.</b> Its meaning; and we do not find the word פתרון except with a dream," "Some ask: from where did Joseph know that three branches are days and not months or years? And it is possible that יום הולדת את פרעה means the day he was born, for indeed there are kings who make a banquet on the day of their year's turning and call all their servants and give them gifts. Or it is possible that the highborn woman was pregnant — and the first [explanation] is closer to me."], :book :genesis, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 40, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"] ["Piotrkow, 1907-1911" "https://www.nli.org.il/he/books/NNL_ALEPH990020973480205171/NLI"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:47:32.811915218Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}